        "original_id": "8503a7de-b58f-5d07-88b0-04f2f9f03d2d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Mercury Tracer, Mazda Familia, Mazda 323, Mazda Protegé, Mazda3, Mazda Axela\n- Companies: Mazda\n- Concepts: vehicle generations, model replacement, badge marketing\n\nFacts:\n- Mazda manufactured the Mazda Familia, also marketed as the Mazda 323 and Mazda Protegé, from 1963 to 2003.\n- All three generations of the Mercury Tracer were based on variations of the Mazda 323 and Mazda Protegé.\n- Mazda replaced the Familia line with the Mazda3 and Mazda Axela for the 2004 model year.",
